=== layout: one-panel

# Group Projects

@body

- 1. Form the group; Decide on Product
- 2. Vision report
  - Any changes to the company now that you are bringing in new talent.
  - Your choice\: New name? New market? Expand product offering? More specifics into the science, etc.
- 3. Group Presentation
  - Dive more into the science
  - Longer presentation
- 4. Group Business Plan
  - Dive more into the science
  - Put it all together in one final document

